mit)。\n- **内存泄漏趋势**：`fact-06f7b7c18d72` 和 `fact-089a0604e5a8` 确认了内存使用量持续增长且重启次数高达 44 次。\n- **服务不可用状态**：`fact-e59c40d4b9e4` 的 Liveness Probe 500 错误解释了为何容器在被杀前处于“假死”或不健康状态，导致重启失败且陷入循环。\n\n**未确认/局限性**：\n- 尚未定位到引发内存泄漏的具体代码路径或对象分配模式（未采集到更早阶段的日志证据）。\n- 没有明确的 `OOMKilled` 事件文本（可能被 K8s 清理或日志聚合未捕获），但 Exit Code 137 结合限制配置已构成闭环证据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 186.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh: 186.0s (Evidence 173.2s, RCA 12.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 219.429, "metrics": {"run_id": "e8de5026b4104eee", "mttr": {"value": "3.7m", "seconds": 219.43572998046875, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95